# Images Folder

Place your images here. Supported formats:
- .jpg / .jpeg
- .png
- .svg
- .webp
- .gif

## Suggested Image Organization:

```
images/
├── logo.png              # Clinic logo
├── backgrounds/          # Background images
│   ├── login-bg.jpg
│   └── pattern.svg
├── icons/               # Icon images
│   ├── physio-icon.svg
│   └── appointment-icon.png
└── photos/              # Photos
    ├── staff/           # Staff photos
    ├── clinic/          # Clinic facility photos
    └── equipment/       # Equipment photos
```

## How to Use Images in React:

### Method 1: Import in Component
```jsx
import logo from '../assets/images/logo.png';

function MyComponent() {
  return <img src={logo} alt="Logo" />;
}
```

### Method 2: Public Folder
Place image in `public/images/` and reference directly:
```jsx
<img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Logo" />
```

### Method 3: Dynamic Import
```jsx
<img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/photo.jpg`} alt="Photo" />
```
